<title>SPAIN: Spain Spanair-pilots call two one-week strikes.</title>
<headline>Spain Spanair-pilots call two one-week strikes.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's airline pilot union SEPLA has called a strike at Spanair from July 14 to 21 and from July 30 to August 6, a spokeswoman for the independent carrier said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;A large number of our (200) pilots are expected to be involved...but we expect to start negotiations and are confident an agreement can be reached,&quot; the spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Pilots claim the firm is not fulfilling its commitments as agreed under an employment pact, the spokewoman said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
